{"id":"7a4fa7874f12cc27","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-graph-access-path.md","title":"项图路径与根访问","display":"df-graph-access-path — 项图路径与根访问","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-graph-access-path","aliases":["56-df-graph-access-path"],"display":"df-graph-access-path — 项图路径与根访问","depends_on":["[[56-df-term-graph]]"],"source_section":"§13.2 Definition 13.2.7","source_printed_pages":"716–717","source_ocr_blocks":[737,738],"source_verification":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-graph-access-path"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-graph-access-path</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-graph-access-path — 项图路径与根访问"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"904f367f2b11cda0\" href=\"?note=904f367f2b11cda0\" title=\"56-df-term-graph\">56-df-term-graph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.2 Definition 13.2.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"716–717"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>737</span><span>738</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)\">\\(G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)\">\\(\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"904f367f2b11cda0\" href=\"?note=904f367f2b11cda0\" title=\"56-df-term-graph\">56-df-term-graph</a>；这些下标记号为该结构的四个分量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(W=\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon=()\">\\(\\epsilon=()\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_j\">\\(p_j\\)</span> 是有限正整数序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 个坐标，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span> 为序列连接。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in N_G\">\\(m,n\\in N_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in W\">\\(p\\in W\\)</span>；节点轨迹按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,|p|\">\\(0,\\ldots,|p|\\)</span> 编号，出边序列按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,\\ldots,|a_G(n)|\">\\(1,\\ldots,|a_G(n)|\\)</span> 编号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Path}_G(m,p,n)\\iff\n\\exists v\\in N_G^{\\{0,\\ldots,|p|\\}}\\;\\bigl(&amp;v(0)=m\\land v(|p|)=n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|p|\\}\\;\n(1\\le p_j\\le|a_G(v(j-1))|\\land\nv(j)=a_G(v(j-1))_{p_j})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Path}_G(m,p,n)\\iff\n\\exists v\\in N_G^{\\{0,\\ldots,|p|\\}}\\;\\bigl(&amp;v(0)=m\\land v(|p|)=n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|p|\\}\\;\n(1\\le p_j\\le|a_G(v(j-1))|\\land\nv(j)=a_G(v(j-1))_{p_j})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_G(n)\\coloneqq\n\\{p\\in W\\mid\\operatorname{Path}_G(r_G,p,n)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Acc}_G\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in N_G}\\operatorname{Acc}_G(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Acc}_G(n)\\coloneqq\n\\{p\\in W\\mid\\operatorname{Path}_G(r_G,p,n)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Acc}_G\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in N_G}\\operatorname{Acc}_G(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{end}_G\\coloneqq\n\\{(p,n)\\in\\operatorname{Acc}_G\\times N_G\\mid\n\\operatorname{Path}_G(r_G,p,n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{end}_G\\coloneqq\n\\{(p,n)\\in\\operatorname{Acc}_G\\times N_G\\mid\n\\operatorname{Path}_G(r_G,p,n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootReachable}(G)\\iff\n\\forall n\\in N_G\\;\\operatorname{Acc}_G(n)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootReachable}(G)\\iff\n\\forall n\\in N_G\\;\\operatorname{Acc}_G(n)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个访问序列唯一确定终点，因为每一步选定出边序号后目标唯一；对路径长度归纳可证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{end}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{end}_G\\)</span> 是定义域恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{Acc}_G\\)</span> 的函数。零长轨迹允许从任何节点到自身，故根总有访问路径。根可达性是额外谓词，未并入基础项图定义；孤立或其他不可达节点仍可存在于基础图中。</p>\n<p>本笔记将原书的路径记号编码为有限节点轨迹，并人工复核了长度零、开放叶节点和循环三种情形。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的本地 Terese (2003) DjVu；OCR页块序号为提取文本块标识，不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-term-graph","status":"resolved","id":"904f367f2b11cda0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term-graph","status":"resolved","id":"904f367f2b11cda0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)$ 满足 $\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)$，见 [[56-df-term-graph]]；这些下标记号为该结构的四个分量。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)","display":false},{"tex":"W=\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon=()","display":false},{"tex":"p_j","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in N_G","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,|p|","display":false},{"tex":"1,\\ldots,|a_G(n)|","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Path}_G(m,p,n)\\iff\n\\exists v\\in N_G^{\\{0,\\ldots,|p|\\}}\\;\\bigl(&v(0)=m\\land v(|p|)=n\\\\\n&\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|p|\\}\\;\n(1\\le p_j\\le|a_G(v(j-1))|\\land\nv(j)=a_G(v(j-1))_{p_j})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}_G(n)\\coloneqq\n\\{p\\in W\\mid\\operatorname{Path}_G(r_G,p,n)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Acc}_G\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in N_G}\\operatorname{Acc}_G(n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{end}_G\\coloneqq\n\\{(p,n)\\in\\operatorname{Acc}_G\\times N_G\\mid\n\\operatorname{Path}_G(r_G,p,n)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RootReachable}(G)\\iff\n\\forall n\\in N_G\\;\\operatorname{Acc}_G(n)\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{end}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}_G","display":false}],"bytes":2235,"backlinks":[{"id":"1c088d04d4303598","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Acc}_G$、$\\operatorname{end}_G$、序列连接 $\\cdot$ 和空序列 $\\epsilon$ 见 [[56-df-graph-access-path]]。"},{"id":"ec93c08d698f2539","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-346","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-graph-access-path.md]]"},{"id":"faf9dd8d1400edec","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"访问路径、展开、互模拟及同构谓词见 [[56-df-graph-access-path]]、[[56-df-graph-unravelling]]、[[56-df-graph-bisimulation]]、[[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]。"},{"id":"e42d17d6f02097e2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Acc}_G$ 与 $\\operatorname{end}_G$ 见 [[56-df-graph-access-path]]；$\\mathsf U_\\Sigma$ 见 [[56-df-graph-unravelling]]；同态谓词见 [[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]。"}],"outgoing":["904f367f2b11cda0"]}